WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.521 --> 00:00:06.140
 Hi, I'm Basim Yafai, Mindset and Growth Mentor and Founder of Two Lives Theory.

2
00:00:07.982 --> 00:00:15.100
 I work with high achievers who have built success on the outside, yet still feel something isn't aligned on the inside.

3
00:00:16.501 --> 00:00:24.080
 You've achieved more than most, but you know there's a deeper level of clarity, peace and purpose you haven't fully stepped into yet.

4
00:00:25.662 --> 00:00:29.580
 I help you create that shift, the transition into your next life.

5
00:00:31.122 --> 00:00:36.520
 Not driven by pressure or old patterns, but by inner stability, focus and identity.

6
00:00:38.582 --> 00:00:44.140
 If you are watching this, maybe you've noticed certain habits, emotions or thoughts holding you back.

7
00:00:45.103 --> 00:00:48.080
 Maybe life feels heavy despite everything you've built.

8
00:00:49.323 --> 00:00:54.120
 I understand that world, I've lived it, rebuilt from it and guided others through it.

9
00:00:55.582 --> 00:01:01.640
 Over the last decade, I've worked with entrepreneurs, athletes and professionals to release what no longer serves them,

10
00:01:02.562 --> 00:01:09.600
 to help them reconnect with who they truly are and realign their life mentally, emotionally, physically and spiritually.

11
00:01:11.281 --> 00:01:13.044
 This is not surface level coaching.

12
00:01:13.245 --> 00:01:22.020
It's precise personal mentorship with real accountability, direct support and honest conversations that create lasting change.

13
00:01:23.561 --> 00:01:29.840
 Together, we will rebuild from the inside out so you can perform, lead and live at your highest level.

14
00:01:31.021 --> 00:01:41.457
So if you are ready to stop repeating these same cycles and step into the life that is waiting for you, I am here when you are ready.

